      "description": "Coker University Careers | Human Resources at Coker University Skip to content Coker University Coker University is a private university in Hartsville, South Carolina. search Search search About expand_more A student-focused, private liberal arts college located in Hartsville, South Carolina. About Coker Overview Why Coker? Strategic Plan 2025-2028 University Leadership Departments & Offices Campus News Campus Map Faculty and Staff Emeriti Academics expand_more Discover the path to your future at Coker University. Academic Overview Coker Academic Programs and Degrees Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs APEC at Coker Honors Program Study Abroad Programs Student Success Writer’s Studio Academic Calendar Admission & Costs expand_more Coker University makes the admissions process seamless for all students. Admission & Aid Overview Freshman Transfer Online and Bridge Programs Graduate Admissions Cost Scholarships Military & Veteran Information Financial Aid Toolkit Net Price Calculator Student Life expand_more With Coker, you’ll find new ideas and a supportive community. Student Life Overview Residence Life and Housing Clubs & Organizations Food Library-Information Technology Center Campus Safety Student Success Campus Center for Health and Wellness Student Accessibility Services Alumni expand_more Welcome home! Thank you for allowing us to be a part of your story! Homecoming Alumni Day Update your Info Awards & Honors Alumni News Alumni Association Board Commentary Magazine Coker Cobra Alumni Business Directory Coker Alumni Attorney Directory Athletics Apply Visit Give Latest Coker News: Coker University Receives NSF Grant to Enhance Research Capacity and Build Sustainable STEM Workforce Pathways in South Carolina Latest: Coker University Receives NSF Grant to Enhance Research Capacity and Build Sustainable STEM Workforce Pathways in South Carolina Apply arrow_forward Visit arrow_forward Give arrow_forward I am: Select  Students Family & Visitors Alumni Faculty & Staff Human Resources CAREERS Office of Human Resources At Coker University, our staff are more than employees. They are team of professionals on a mission to launch the next generation of world changers. High performance leadership is about excellence and integrity at all levels. And a career at Coker is founded on the desire to lead with compassion, enthusiasm, and a heart for service. If you’re seeking a purpose-driven academic culture, our Cobra family is a perfect fit. Home / Offices & Services / Human Resources Related Links Faculty Jobs Faculty, Staff, Coach, and Administration Jobs View Open Staff & Administration Positions Why Choose Coker for Your Next Career Move A student-focused, private university with a liberal arts core, Coker University is located in Hartsville, South Carolina. Founded in 1908, Coker is a bachelor’s and master’s degree-granting institution and competes in 24 NCAA Division II sports. Ours is a community that will value your influence, support your expertise, and expand your leadership, career, and life potential. Make Your Next Move GO HIGHER WITH A CAREER AT COKER upcoming events WHAT’S HAPPENING AT COKER View Calendar Coker News Read more Aug 27, 2026 Coker University Receives NSF Grant to Enhance Research Capacity and Build Sustainable STEM Workforce Pathways in South Carolina $615,000 award funds undergraduate scholars, faculty mentors, and research infrastructure over four years \nAug…. Aug 21, 2026 Coker University Announces District Days, Offers to Fund Transportation for Local High Schools Coker University is making it a little easier for local students to experience campus in person this year…. Jun 05, 2026 Coker University Announces New Kids in Parks TRACK Trail at Kalmia Gardens June 5, 2026 — Coker University is proud to announce that Kalmia Gardens has officially joined the national K… Be part of our community, as we work together to learn, lead, and inspire. Request Information arrow_forward Plan Your Visit arrow_forward Apply 300 E. College Avenue Hartsville, SC 29550 Main: (843) 383-8000 Admissions: (843) 383-8050 Emergency: (843) 383-8140 Visitors Visit Coker Campus Map Campus Safety Public Disclosures Campus Calendar McCall School Events Kalmia Gardens of Coker University Coker University Store Venue Rentals Things To Do in Hartsville, SC Careers Alumni & Friends Ways to Give President’s Home Fundraiser Strategic Plan Coker University Store Faculty and Staff Emeriti Coker University’s 17th President Coker Society Students Offices & Services Brightspace CobraStop Coker Email Library Directory Campus News Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Online Payments Organizational Chart © 2026 Coker University | Privacy Policy expand_less Get Started Visit Get Info Apply The University is currently experiencing intermittent telephone disruption.  We appreciate your patience while this is resolved. × Make Your Year End Gift to Coker University! https://www.coker/yearend/ × Year End 2022 https://www.coker.edu/donations/yearend-2/ × Our Spring Sale Has Started You can see how this popup was set up in our step-by-step guide: https://wppopupmaker.com/guides/auto-opening-announcement-popups/ ×"
